# Pre-push gate. Deliberately `make verify`, NOT `make check`.
#
# `check` additionally runs `build`, which rewrites apps/api/dist underneath a
# running `nest start --watch` and takes the dev server down with it — a hook
# that kills your dev server every time you push is a hook people disable. It is
# also the slowest step, and `typecheck` already covers type errors.
#
# CI runs the full `make check` including `build` on every PR and on pushes to
# `dev` and `main`,
# so nothing is actually ungated — the build break is caught on a GitHub-hosted
# runner instead of on your machine.
make verify
